Placeholder — setup.sh fetches the real cert from http://${PKI_IP}/cert/ca.crt
into certs/root_ca.crt (gitignored). ts-fitness mounts it at
/staging-certs/root_ca.crt so the sidecar trusts step-ca during tailnet
login. Plain-HTTP fetch is intentional (chicken-and-egg: can't TLS-verify
step-ca without already having its root).
